## Important limitations and security notice

- Asset files are not transferred. Missing imported meshes, textures, materials, prefabs, scripts, TerrainData, animation clips, or other assets must be obtained through source control.
- The current connection uses plain TCP without built-in authentication or encryption. Use trusted collaborators on a trusted LAN or private VPN.
- Only the active Unity scene is synchronized. Multi-scene editing and Prefab Mode are not currently declared supported.
- The host remains authoritative and must keep Unity and the scene open.
- Undo/Redo propagates the resulting supported object state, not a shared distributed history.
- Dense generated or ProBuilder meshes send substantially more data and can cause pauses or exceed the message limit.
- Performance depends on object count, component size, mesh density, network latency, and all connected computers. No unlimited-user or unlimited-scene-size claim is made.

Read the exact limitations in `Documentation/LIMITATIONS.md` before purchase and use.

